      "evidencePublicDataset": false,
      "notes": "Published Oct 19, 2026 by Snorre Fagerland. Follows Gambit Security's September 2026 marketplace campaign - the recovered staging server named Cairn among the attacker's harnesses. NorForge verified a live uploader webshell on a large hardware parts vendor and one very large US retailer case; victim names reported elsewhere came from Reuters, not from the report. Trufflehog over the panel data found hundreds of secrets with 11% verified still valid. Model attribution is unconfirmed: worker names read claudecode_deepseek-v4.1-flash and pi_openrouter_deepseek suggest a Claude Code harness driving DeepSeek models. Distinct victim set and distinct disclosure from the ReliaQuest single-server takeover of Oct 7."
